OL,3,AFamilies of British victims mark 25th
OL,4,Aanniversary of 9/11
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies of British victims of 9/11
OL,7,Fwere among those who gathered in
OL,8,FLondon's Queen Elizabeth Olympic Park
OL,9,Fon Friday to mark the 25th anniversary
OL,10,Fof the attacks in the US.
OL,12,FThe event, hosted by UK charity Since
OL,13,F9/11, was held near a memorial
OL,14,Fsculpture made from steel recovered
OL,15,Ffrom the ruins of the World Trade
OL,16,FCenter.
OL,18,FIn a video address played to attendees,
OL,19,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said: "On
OL,20,Fthis anniversary, we must remember that
OL,21,Fhatred and fear did not have the last
OL,22,Fword on 9/11."
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
