OL,3,AHouthis claim major advance in Yemen
OL,4,Aand tighten grip on Red Sea shipping
OL,5,Alane
OL,6,
OL,7,FYemen's Houthis have claimed a major
OL,8,Fadvance on the western Red Sea coast,
OL,9,Fconsolidating their grip on the key
OL,10,Finternational shipping route.
OL,12,FThe Iran-backed group seized Perim
OL,13,FIsland at the mouth of the waterway in
OL,14,Fthe Bab al-Mandab Strait, a source from
OL,15,FYemen's internationally recognised
OL,16,Fgovernment told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
