OL,3,AHouthis claim major advance in Yemen
OL,4,Aand tighten grip on Red Sea shipping
OL,5,Alane
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes a day after the Houthis
OL,8,Fcaptured the strategic port city of
OL,9,FMokha from Saudi-backed pro-government
OL,10,Fforces, according to military sources.
OL,11,FA Yemeni military official told the AFP
OL,12,Fnews agency the Houthis now control the
OL,13,Fentire coastline.
OL,15,FThe Houthis earlier said they posed no
OL,16,Fthreat to international shipping but
OL,17,Freiterated their threat to target
OL,18,Fvessels from Saudi Arabia.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
