OL,3,ANorway's Princess Astrid dies two days
OL,4,Aafter attending brother King Harald's
OL,5,Afuneral
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrincess Astrid of Norway, the sister
OL,8,Fof the late King Harald V, has died at
OL,9,Fthe age of 94, two days after attending
OL,10,Fhis funeral, the country's royal palace
OL,11,Fhas announced.
OL,13,FThe new king, Haakon VIII, said that
OL,14,F"throughout her long life, Princess
OL,15,FAstrid represented the Royal House in a
OL,16,Fwarm and dutiful manner".
OL,18,FHarald died last month, aged 89, after
OL,19,Fmore than 35 years as king. His funeral
OL,20,Fwas Astrid's last public engagement.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
