OL,3,ANorway's Princess Astrid dies two days
OL,4,Aafter attending brother King Harald's
OL,5,Afuneral
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe princess will be buried at state
OL,8,Fexpense and flags will be flown at
OL,9,Fhalf-mast across Norway, Prime Minister
OL,10,FJonas Gahr StC8re said.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
